{"Using reminder.retryCount + 1 relies on the value read before scheduling, causing a race condition where concurrent requests can read the same retryCount and write the same new value, losing one increment - should use Prisma's atomic increment instead": 0.8297120332717896, "Deleting reminders solely on retryCount > 1 without scoping to WorkflowMethods.SMS will remove retries for every workflow method (email, WhatsApp, etc.), even though this cron job only manages SMS reminders - the second branch of the OR should be restricted to SMS reminders": 0.9751558899879456}